Error [E3303]: This no-OS program allocates memory but has no allocator fact.
  --> tests/ui/freestanding_e3303.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     xs :: [1, 2, 3]
    |           ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: No-OS targets do not provide an implicit system heap.
 Fix: Select a typed allocator provider, or use heap-free Core operations.
